{"at": "2026-10-31T12:42:27.795165+00:00", "event_id": "01M68ZQ6JKYQNXK5CX61ZT28G3", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M68ZQ261TWK1F3XEYJHTQSD0", "final_answer": "Application/reporting half only (generation stays in #3947): generator-shape proposals gain an optional structured payload validated by the existing ProposalPayload union, synthesize translates translatable ones into the typed Proposal it applies, names every untranslatable one, and emits a diagnostics block naming record shape, finding counts and zero planned; exit codes stay unchanged so the documented dry-run exit-0 contract holds.", "mission_id": "01M68ZKX1DCY9S7NM80G0YQFKY", "mission_slug": "retrospect-synthesize-generator-proposals-01M68ZKX", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": "Batch-14 triage on #6385 splits generation (#3947) from application/reporting; the issue itself names a structured field as the safer direction than verb parsing, and its Minimum bar is that a created record with findings must not end in a silent successful-looking empty batch. Changing the documented exit code would be a contract change on a P2 fix.", "recorded_at": "2026-10-31T12:42:27.795165Z", "resolved_by": "Ivan-Melck", "run_id": "01M68ZQ261TWK1F3XEYJHTQSD0", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-31T12:42:27.794277Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
